AnyPS5 sanitizer runtime port

This directory is a modified sanitizer runtime port, not an unmodified upstream
compiler-rt runtime. It was introduced on 2026-10-30 from the AnyPS5 runtime at
1bb57ba9ff653a2cbffa1294c2cc151c1cc03a71. AnyPS5 contributions retain the project's
GNU General Public License version 2 terms, reproduced in LICENSE.GPL-2.0.

The compiler-rt adaptations retain the upstream Apache License version 2.0 with
LLVM Exceptions. The full licence, LLVM exception, legacy notices and disclaimers
are preserved in ../../LICENSE.TXT. The unmodified source files and their original
notices remain in the parent compiler-rt tree at LLVM 18.1.8, commit
3b5b5c1ec4a3095ab096dd780e84d7ab81f3d7ff.

Upstream notice retained for the adapted compiler-rt portions:

