Source mapping relative to compiler-rt/lib:

Runtime.cpp: asan/asan_poisoning.cpp (shadow segments, user/intra-object/alloca
poisoning), asan/asan_rtl.cpp and asan/asan_report.cpp (access callbacks and
report dispatch), and public sanitizer interfaces. The host entry points,
caller-site transport and validation are modified for AnyPS5.

src/Container.hpp: asan/asan_poisoning.cpp, including FixUnalignedStorage,
contiguous and double-ended container transitions and FindBadAddress.

src/Allocator.cpp: asan/asan_allocator.cpp (redzone selection, allocation
validation and diagnostic text), sanitizer_common/sanitizer_allocator_size_class_map.h
(size-class computation), and asan/asan_stats.cpp (statistics text). The backing
provider, std::map registry and global quarantine are host integration changes.

src/FakeStack.cpp: asan/asan_fake_stack.h and asan/asan_fake_stack.cpp (flag/frame
layout, size classes, allocation and garbage collection), and asan/asan_thread.cpp
(fiber/no-return behavior). Allocation, locking and TLS lifecycle are modified.

src/Globals.cpp and src/Globals.hpp: asan/asan_globals.cpp and
asan/asan_interface_internal.h (global descriptors, redzones and ODR diagnostics).
The descriptor-copy registry and array validation are AnyPS5 changes.

src/Describe.cpp, src/Describe.hpp, src/Report.hpp and src/ShadowCheck.hpp:
asan/asan_descriptions.cpp, asan/asan_errors.cpp, asan/asan_report.cpp and
asan/asan_poisoning.cpp (address classifications, shadow magic and report text),
with host address lookup and additional validation.

src/Ubsan.cpp: ubsan/ubsan_handlers.cpp, ubsan/ubsan_handlers.h,
ubsan/ubsan_value.cpp, ubsan/ubsan_value.h, ubsan/ubsan_diag.cpp and
ubsan/ubsan_monitor.cpp (metadata, value decoding, handler decisions and diagnostics).
Legacy type-mismatch and nonnull-return layouts are based on the public
LLVM 3.8 ABI declarations at llvmorg-3.8.0/compiler-rt/lib/ubsan/ubsan_handlers.h;
the port does not compile a LLVM 3.8 implementation file.

src/Coverage.cpp: sanitizer_common/sanitizer_coverage_libcdep_new.cpp and
sanitizer_common/sanitizer_coverage_interface.inc (coverage interface and file
format), implemented with host file I/O and module lookup.

src/ShadowWindows.cpp, src/ShadowLinux.cpp, src/BackingMemory.hpp,
src/ModuleLookup.cpp, src/ReportFile.cpp, src/StackBounds.cpp and src/StackTrace.cpp:
AnyPS5 host integration using the Windows/POSIX platform APIs. The shadow scale
and offset match LLVM 18.1.8 instrumentation. They are included in this port to
keep the runtime and its host adaptations together.

Interface.hpp and CMakeLists.txt provide the AnyPS5 integration boundary and
source build. This port remains partial and is not a console-verified runtime.
